  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "3 large bananas, mashed",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "1 egg",
    "0.33333334326744 cup butter, melted"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 12-cup muffin tin or line cups with paper liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/23lnDYOp-SmoRvxRYx3UpqmpY-s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-gw-42719-Banana-Muffins-ddmfs-4x3-ingredients-86cf5b08a0c64a8ca08727c9d288cf05.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/42719/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, baking powder, baking soda, and salt together in a bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aBsntgXQb6OrBQyyMaspqBr-L04=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-gw-42719-Banana-Muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-f8d58c3a261246d4aaf7d34e8214d8af.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/42719/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix bananas, sugar, egg, and melted butter in a separate large bowl until well combined; fold in flour mixture until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l3c6tD8oqok0Qa2TeLZ7FUsFBbQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-gw-42719-Banana-Muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-2-c902bb9f67ab449393e8dc60e637be6d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/42719/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon batter into the prepared muffin cups, filling each 2/3 full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u2oEQqsoIwuIcEtIG9s-YnINN5E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-gw-42719-Banana-Muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-de254e1b6a4f45379ec600c28993fb77.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/42719/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until tops spring back when lightly pressed, about 25 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/p9T84iegPt80oP0UYyeE3DlhnL0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-gw-42719-Banana-Muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-e479d78a5aaf48d48b0c54bf54bb3709.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/42719/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool briefly in the tin, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/p9T84iegPt80oP0UYyeE3DlhnL0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-gw-42719-Banana-Muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-e479d78a5aaf48d48b0c54bf54bb3709.jpg"
